{"version":1,"id":"ella-langley-you-look-like-you-love-me","title":"You Look Like You Love Me","artist":"Ella Langley","key":"G","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/ella-langley/you-look-like-you-love-me/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Aaron Raitiere, Riley Green and Ella Langley","chords":[{"symbol":"B","canonical":"B","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,3,6],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C#m","canonical":"C#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[1,4,8],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"E","canonical":"E","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,8,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F#","canonical":"F#","keyboardPitchClasses":[6,10,1],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"instrumental","text":"[Intro]","columns":9,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"section","text":"[Primeira Parte]","columns":16,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"I was all but twenty two, I think at the time","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"I'd been out on the road, lonely at night","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"And it'd been a while, so it was on my mind","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":23,"beat":1},{"symbol":"B","column":48,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F#","column":52,"beat":3}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Well, I saw him walk in, with his cowboy hat","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"And I thought to myself, I could use some of that","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"His boots like glass on a sawdust floor, huh","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"Had moves like nothing I'd ever seen before","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"So I walked right up, and I pulled him to the side","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"I handed that man a beer and looked him in the eyes","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"And I said \"Baby, I think you're gonna wanna hear this\"","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":23,"beat":1},{"symbol":"B","column":53,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F#","column":57,"beat":3}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"Then I told him","columns":15,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Excuse me","columns":9,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"You look like you love me","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"You look like you want me to want you to come on home","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":19,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":34,"beat":1},{"symbol":"B","column":52,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F#","column":59,"beat":3}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"And baby I don't blame you","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"For looking me up and down across this room","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":27,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm drunk and I'm ready to leavе","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":26,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"And you look like you love me","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":24,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"section","text":"[Segunda Parte]","columns":15,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"Wеll I was down at a local beer joint with a few of the guys","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"When this cute little country girl caught my eye","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"And boy let me tell you, she was the prettiest thing I'd ever seen in a pair of boots","columns":85,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":62,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"Well she walked right up to me, handed me a beer","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"Gave me a look like \"Let's get out of here\"","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"And that's when I realized that she was every cowboy's dream come true","columns":70,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":58,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"She told me this right here","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"She said","columns":8,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"Excuse me","columns":9,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"You look like you love me","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"Y